+<main><section aria-label="Planned research"><article class="featured"><div><span class="badge planned">Planned study</span><h2>Anchored VWAP excursion and return study</h2><p>Planned fresh study of 2/2.5/3-sigma departures, VWAP return probabilities and first-touch bounce/through response at 5/10/15/20/50 two-minute candle horizons, separately for Asia, London, New York and Globex.</p><p class="scope">Pinned session_anchored_vwap 1.0.0 two-minute features and matching unadjusted one-minute paths through 2026-09-18. Price delta supported; true buy/sell volume delta absent from these inputs.</p><p class="muted">Planning and coding-agent handoff only. Proposed definitions are not frozen and no new outcomes have been calculated. Existing VWAP runs remain unchanged; old statistics will not be reused.</p><div class="links"><a href="../studies/15_vwap_excursion_response/plan.md">Read the research plan</a><a href="../studies/15_vwap_excursion_response/study.yaml">Proposed settings</a><a href="../studies/15_vwap_excursion_response/inputs.lock.json">Pinned inputs</a><a href="../studies/15_vwap_excursion_response/notes.md">Decisions</a></div></div><div class="featured-aside"><div class="eyebrow">Candidate strategies</div><ol></ol></div></article></section><section id="studies"><div class="section-head"><h2>Research archive</h2><p>Original results, tables, figures, and provenance. Open a study to browse every saved run.</p></div><div class="note">Historical results were imported without recalculation or a new review. “Latest” reflects natural run-ID ordering. Recency alone does not select a reference run or establish a strategy recommendation.</div><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="meta-line"><span class="id">01_reversal_follow_through</span><span class="badge">Historical import</span></div><h3>Reversal follow-through</h3><p class="description">How often do Range XV reversals continue, how far, and with what adverse movement?</p><div class="pill-row"><span c