ous-RTH VA breakout and retest</a></h3><p>Does a confirmed retest of fixed previous-RTH VAH or VAL favor continuation over 5, 10, or 20 minutes?</p><span class="badge planned">exploratory_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">03</div><h3><a href="../strategies/gc_ema_outer_lower_long.md">Long after a GC outer lower EMA band close</a></h3><p>What long-side adverse and favorable movement follows an outer lower EMA band close, and does a 2025-selected candle filter improve the 2026 profile?</p><span class="badge planned">descriptive_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">04</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_extreme_fade.md">Fade the first close outside 2σ</a></h3><p>Does a fresh extreme close offer useful retracement before further adverse extension?</p><span class="badge planned">weak_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">05</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_reentry_fade.md">Fade after re-entry inside 2σ</a></h3><p>Does visible rejection improve the opportunity enough to justify waiting?</p><span class="badge planned">exploratory_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">06</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_return_after_departure.md">Return to VWAP after departure</a></h3><p>How often does a meaningful departure return during its observation window?</p><span class="badge planned">descriptive_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">07</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_first_retest_bounce.md">Bounce on the first VWAP retest</a></h3><p>Does the first causal return to VWAP lead to movement back toward the approach side?</p><span class="badge planned">weak_evidence</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">08</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_cross_acceptance_retest.md">VWAP cross, acceptance, and retest</a></h3><p>Does accepted price on a new side make VWAP useful support or resistance?</p><span class="badge planned">proposed</span></article><article class="card strategy"><div class="num">09</div><h3><a href="../strategies/vwap_outside_band_continuation.md">Sustained outside-band continuation</a></h3><p>Does a known period of outside closes distinguish persistence from reversion?</p><span class="badge planned">proposed</span></article></div></section><hr class="rule"><section id="resources"><div class="section-head"><h2>Data &amp; supporting artifacts</h2><p>Publication records and historical presentation exports stay connected to the research library.</p></div><div class="resources"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Bhishma / publications</div><h3>Data quality and contracts</h3><p class="muted">Published data remains at the configured storage root. The repository preserves catalog records and quality reports.</p><div class="links"><a href="../catalog/datasets/session_anchored_vwap__1.0.0.release.json">VWAP 1.0.0 release</a><a href="../studies/05_session_vwap/inputs.lock.json">Pinned input hashes</a></div><ul class="resource-list"><li><a href="../reports/quality/GLBX-20260920-577W4VCSK7.md">GLBX-20260920-577W4VCSK7</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/GLBX-20260920-QQQSGCKWES.md">GLBX-20260920-QQQSGCKWES</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/gc_ema_deviation_bands__1.0.0.md">gc ema deviation bands · 1.0.0</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/nq_causal_vp_hvn__1.0.0.md">nq causal vp hvn · 1.0.0</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/session_anchored_vwap__1.0.0.md">session anchored vwap · 1.0.0</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/tradingview_daily_context__1.0.0.md">tradingview daily context · 1.0.0</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/tv_indicators__dridr_ohlcv_5m__v1.md">tv indicators · dridr ohlcv 5m · v1</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/volume_lead_back_adjusted_v1.md">volume lead back adjusted v1</a></li><li><a href="../reports/quality/volume_lead_unadjusted_v1.md">volume lead unadjusted v1</a></